    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/5bd68da0b831461362b027633d16ede2.poster.avif?t=1755386780\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/5bd68da0b831461362b027633d16ede2.webm?t=1755386780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/5bd68da0b831461362b027633d16ede2.mp4?t=1755386780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Makuta Stories! A wacky RPG where you follow Makuta and his friends in this big adventure to find all of the Rainbow Gems, pass The Trial, and of course, have lots of fun along the way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>CUSTOMIZE YOUR STATS THROUGH FIGHTING STYLES</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/13077373d9b46d6e4c235d6b4bfe1bbb.avif?t=1755386780\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>MASTER THE 1VS1 BATTLE MECHANICS</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/96d42276e32b3f3a28095bc5a25052f8.avif?t=1755386780\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>COMPLETE OPTIONAL SIDE QUESTS FROM LOTS OF PEOPLE (and not-so people!)</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/de2c5ca801f7960f8eefd35b4503b40a.avif?t=1755386780\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>FIGHT YOUR WAY THROUGH LOTS OF WACKY AND UNIQUE LOCATIONS</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/80dcb58aa18389bcdb2356325e11f629.avif?t=1755386780\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/5bd68da0b831461362b027633d16ede2.poster.avif?t=1755386780\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/5bd68da0b831461362b027633d16ede2.webm?t=1755386780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/5bd68da0b831461362b027633d16ede2.mp4?t=1755386780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Makuta Stories! A wacky RPG where you follow Makuta and his friends in this big adventure to find all of the Rainbow Gems, pass The Trial, and of course, have lots of fun along the way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>CUSTOMIZE YOUR STATS THROUGH FIGHTING STYLES</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/13077373d9b46d6e4c235d6b4bfe1bbb.avif?t=1755386780\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>MASTER THE 1VS1 BATTLE MECHANICS</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/96d42276e32b3f3a28095bc5a25052f8.avif?t=1755386780\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>COMPLETE OPTIONAL SIDE QUESTS FROM LOTS OF PEOPLE (and not-so people!)</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/de2c5ca801f7960f8eefd35b4503b40a.avif?t=1755386780\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>FIGHT YOUR WAY THROUGH LOTS OF WACKY AND UNIQUE LOCATIONS</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/80dcb58aa18389bcdb2356325e11f629.avif?t=1755386780\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Makuta Stories is a wacky RPG all about fast-paced and exciting turn-based combat! Play as Makuta and his friends as you explore Stardust Island, engage in both normal battles and 1vs1 duels, hunt for secrets and learn lots of different Fighting Styles for you! I hope you're up for the challenge!",
